    P --> Q[Phosphoenolpyruvate]
    Q --> R[Pyruvate Kinase]
    R --> S[Pyruvate]
    S --> T[Glycolysis Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    C --> U[Pentose Phosphate Pathway]
    U --> V[NADPH Production]
